    "rationale": "Lofty, leading-indicator-weighted goals across content, social, reels, video, and website traffic — tracked daily, weekly, and monthly. The nightly review measures actuals against these, fires gap triggers, and writes copy-paste prompts so Aaron can bring them back to Claude and act. Recalibrated 2026-07-08 (weekly strategist): ad video-views raised 6k→45k after week-1 pace blew past it; posts-shipped right-sized 90→60 to match the FB-only counter at 2/day (IG counted separately); audience/follower targets held (back-loaded, still warming). Safe-aggressive-max cadence (FB 2/day, IG daily, reels+shorts daily).",
